  "description": "<div class=\"product-description rf-tee-white\">\n<p>Refresh your essentials with our <strong>Classic White RF T-Shirt</strong>, crafted from high-quality, breathable cotton for everyday comfort and performance. Whether you're pushing through a workout or relaxing at home, the soft fabric keeps you cool and comfortable.</p>\n<p>The crisp white color delivers a clean, versatile look that pairs easily with any outfit. Designed with a relaxed, athletic fit, this tee allows for plenty of freedom of movement while maintaining a flattering silhouette. Reinforced stitching and durable construction help it keep its shape and brightness through frequent washes.</p>\n<p><strong>Simple, timeless, and built for your daily rotation.</strong></p>\n</div>\n",
